    <item>
      <title>Identity Is Not the Keyword</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/disent-kws/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 23:05:53 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/disent-kws/</guid>
      <description>A deep dive into DISENT-KWS: a 1.8M parameter model that disentangles phonetic content from speaker identity for robust custom keyword spotting on edge devices. Combines adversarial training, mutual information minimization, and dual-head scoring for speaker-aware wake word detection.</description>
