      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;disent-kws--speech-disentanglement-for-robust-custom-word-detection&#34;&gt;DISENT-KWS — Speech Disentanglement for Robust Custom Word Detection&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
